// Shape of `<type>.get_all_records()`: { OpaqueRef: rawRecord }.
// Hand-built (no host available for this POC) but field-for-field against
// @xen-orchestra/lite/src/libs/xen-api/xen-api.types.ts, which is generated
// from the real XAPI schema.
//
// One running HVM VM on one host, with the full link neighbourhood the vm
// transform walks: metrics, guest_metrics, VBD -> VDI -> SR, VIF -> network,
// VTPM, plus a snapshot and the pool itself.

